  "caption": "The + and the panel buttons open one menu: a check 14 before each shown panel, its key dim, a hidden one dimmed.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div>\n          <div class=\"kanso-menu\">\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu__heading\">Panels</div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-file\"/></svg>Files<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\">⌃⇧1</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item kanso-control--hover\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-plug\"/></svg>Ports<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row kanso-text--dim\"><use href=\"#lu-grip-vertical\"/></svg></span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-chart-column\"/></svg>Spend<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\">⌃⇧3</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-git-pull-request\"/></svg>PR<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\">⌃⇧4</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-trophy\"/></svg>Shipped<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\">⌃⇧5</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-check\"/></svg><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-git-fork\"/></svg>Worktrees<span class=\"kanso-story__theme\">⌃⇧6</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kanso-menu-item kanso-menu-item--dim\"><span class=\"kanso-menu-item__spacer\"></span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"